{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id35580054"}, "name":{"label":"the_beerd"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-07-28T06:19:39-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0"}, "id":{"label":"1702039944"}, "title":{"label":"Not Quite Functional"}, "content":{"label":"I like the design of he app, but I've found the Streak counter to not work as expected. \n\nExample: I set up a goal of going to the gym 3 times per week. I have done so for 9 weeks in a row, and entered the data as such. However, this app tells me my Streak is 5, as I went to the gym 5x in one week. Counter intuitive, to say the least. \n\nHoping an update will fix.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
