{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id339235272"}, "name":{"label":"curiouspuppy"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-04-06T18:34:51-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.2"}, "id":{"label":"1582454053"}, "title":{"label":"Good but needs improvement"}, "content":{"label":"Overall I like this app. But for the price I paid, $5, I want two improvements:\n1) More than 6 tasks (I need a dozen)\n2) Longer than a week routine (I need a month)\nAnother feature - some kinds of rewarding the achievement - would be also good such as receiving a special icon, etc.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id130546265"}, "name":{"label":"Simestra Lovelock"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-03-26T20:22:20-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.2"}, "id":{"label":"1573540051"}, "title":{"label":"I use this app every day!"}, "content":{"label":"There aren't many apps I can say I use and interact with every day, but this is one of the few. This app is a great motivator and has helped me to achieve daily tasks that are important to me. My music, writing, second language acquisition and fitness have all improved in leaps and bounds as a direct result of Streaks. In a way, this app acts as kind of a World of Warcraft \"daily quest\" that taps into that same compulsive drive I feel while gaming and farming for trophies and achievements. I would love to see trophies, titles and badges or some other kind of recognition type of reward incorporated into this app in the future, to motivate me to reach certain milestone streaks (ie: 25 day streaks, 50, 100, 250, 500, etc). This is by far the most consulted, the most used and the most helpful app on my iPhone.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
