{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id118802958"}, "name":{"label":"Notahappycamper10000"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-01-10T23:51:16-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.0.5"}, "id":{"label":"1519665903"}, "title":{"label":"Don't listen to them!!! They are fake people!"}, "content":{"label":"I am telling you I have never had a worst app in my life. I payed 6$ for the bundle and I've never been so unhappy about an app in my life that I needed to write a review. This app is a scam. Basically all you need to do is pick something you'd like to do, and then press on the button when you do it. It doesn't help you figure out what you need to do or how u need to do it, for insistence you could eat a cheeseburger and then say it was a healthy meal. Or see you drank 2L of water but only had a bottle. I don't know how to properly describe how bad this app is just know if you do get it, you'll be unbelievably unhappy. This app needs a lot of work.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
